{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/f56ccaaa3eac765ea43ffed859170211.poster.avif?t=1760907187\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/f56ccaaa3eac765ea43ffed859170211.webm?t=1760907187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/f56ccaaa3eac765ea43ffed859170211.mp4?t=1760907187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What would you do if your pet cat transformed into an ancient Egyptian god?</h2>In Passage: A Job Interview Simulator, take on the role of a destitute job-seeker, making tough decisions while you manage seeking a career in the hyper-competitive job market. Luckily, you\u2019ve got your pet cat to help with work-life balance! <br><br>Passage includes a branching narrative spanning 8+ hours of gameplay, an original storyline, original character art, an immersive OST, and 5 unique endings!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP INTO THE WORLD OF A GRADUATE JOBSEEKER</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/1e1df66c7b43a67dd46b03dc212af12a.poster.avif?t=1760907187\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/1e1df66c7b43a67dd46b03dc212af12a.webm?t=1760907187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/1e1df66c7b43a67dd46b03dc212af12a.mp4?t=1760907187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Passage, you\u2019re a recent college graduate desperately searching for a job. You\u2019re plagued with constant nightmares about rejection - until, one day, your beloved cat comes to your aid! With his help, you\u2019re able to start taking on the dark world of corporate interviews - these days, an interview can be the difference between life and death\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPRESS YOUR NEWFOUND CAT-GOD</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6d99c29f424c7175727479eaa109975f.poster.avif?t=1760907187\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6d99c29f424c7175727479eaa109975f.webm?t=1760907187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6d99c29f424c7175727479eaa109975f.mp4?t=1760907187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your newfound friend isn\u2019t just useful for advice - they have unique powers to help you out, too! They\u2019ll even stop time for you\u2026 better hope you impress them with your interview technique, though - there are only so many employers in the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER DARK SECRETS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6089c1346c85e036d93d421dd91c0308.poster.avif?t=1760907187\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6089c1346c85e036d93d421dd91c0308.webm?t=1760907187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6089c1346c85e036d93d421dd91c0308.mp4?t=1760907187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The world of corporate interviews can be dark - and many lose hope, but with our help you can succeed! Discover the truth about your prospective employers and your nightmares as you embark on your epic quest for employment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made jointly in Michigan and Washington.</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Jumpstart Your Career","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2311230/25c76ebd804d802d78f77224392e7e4a86f004bd.jpg"},{"name":"A Rough Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2311230/244913f90d13d808a81a2b129324df8f0834e26b.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome Aboard, Crewmate!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2311230/fe64f9082b5f8f8438f6ac291ad0f19b25716c03.jpg"},{"name":"The Pyramid of Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2311230/1135e1c7e45d5545959c645818c01adb87bcd883.jpg"},{"name":"Be YOUR Own Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2311230/749a51662d2b4574975371b5aa47dc9cf35488d9.jpg"},{"name":"Internet Superstar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2311230/68134567e90d53cbda0cdffad40553738655085d.jpg"},{"name":"Viral Embarrassment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2311230/e0bb6abf266d97b6129182e1591439a0bca3c670.jpg"},{"name":"Putting Yourself Out There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2311230/5e377525ba7dadec45d1de7c833af88b6aa796a5.jpg"},{"name":"Ran the Gauntlet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2311230/2eb324f0bab60380e7d69d74634ba9814f4a67de.jpg"},{"name":"Tell Me How You Really Feel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2311230/5d279a7f70773e9e07cb49600e1f073f7f179b3a.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2311230?t=1760907187","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2311230?t=176